hooks-proposal 0001: property hooks / asymmetric visibility / readonly runtime
semantics in props.rs (+ one call-site line in place.rs).
Base: 3be3cf4.  Apply with `git apply crates/php-vm/hooks-proposals/0001-props-hooks-asym-readonly-runtime.diff`.

php-src behaviour (Zend/zend_object_handlers.c, zend_execute.c, zend_objects.c):
 * zend_std_unset_property: the readonly / set-visibility errors only apply
   when the slot is defined, IS_PROP_UNINIT, or no __unset() can take over
   (or its guard is active); unsetting an uninitialized typed property just
   clears IS_PROP_UNINIT and bypasses __unset().  Error scope is that of
   the running __unset() ("from scope D").
 * zend_std_has_property: uninitialized typed properties skip __isset();
   set-only virtual hooked properties throw "Cannot read from set-only
   virtual property"; virtual props read from their own hook throw
   "Must not read from virtual property".
 * zend_fetch_property_address (BP_VAR_W/RW/UNSET), i.e. property_container
   (now takes `rw`) and read_property_for_unset:
   - readonly / no-set-access properties: objects are handed out as a copy
     (`$r = &$o->ro` no longer turns the slot into a reference), everything
     else throws "Cannot indirectly modify readonly property C::$p" /
     "Cannot indirectly modify private(set) property C::$p from ..." --
     also for an uninitialized readonly from inside the class (`$this->a[] = 1`,
     `$this->p = &$x`), and for nested unset (`unset($o->ro['k'])`);
   - RW fetch of an uninitialized typed property: "Typed property ... must
     not be accessed before initialization" before the visibility errors;
   - hooked properties outside their hooks go through the get hook (or the
     backing value without one); non-reference, non-object results throw
     "Indirect modification of C::$p is not allowed"; nested unset through
     a get hook returning an ArrayAccess object reaches offsetUnset.
 * zend_assign_to_property_reference: `$o->p =& $x` where the fetch yields a
   value (hooked property, __get()) throws "Cannot assign by reference to
   overloaded object" (after running the get hook); inside the hook an
   uninitialized typed backing value is bound.
 * IS_PROP_REINITABLE: during __clone() each initialized readonly property
   may be re-initialized once ("Cannot modify readonly property" on the
   second write).  New `Vm::with_reinitable_props()` wraps __clone() and is
   meant for __unserialize() too (see 0002).  The "already re-initialized"
   marker lives in `prop_guards` under a new kind 4 (G_REINIT), cleared per
   object before/after cloning.
 * is_protected_compatible_scope(prop_info->prototype->ce, scope): protected
   access and protected(set) are checked against the class of the topmost
   non-private declaration (new `prop_proto_class`).
 * ZEND_INIT_PARENT_PROPERTY_HOOK_CALL: "Cannot use "parent" when current
   class scope has no parent", "Cannot access private property A::$p"; the
   implicit trampoline is `A::$p::get()` (0 args) / `A::$p::set()` (1 arg),
   scoped to the declaring class, so ZPP errors read "A::$prop::get() expects
   exactly 0 arguments, 1 given"; parent set writes through references.
 * Hooks imported from a trait run in the using class's scope (not the trait).
 * zend_should_call_hook / lazy objects: an initialized lazy proxy's real
   instance counts as the hook's $this; backing-store access of a hooked
   property initializes a lazy object (lazy_object_for skips hooked props).

Fixes (measured on 3be3cf4, property_hooks + asymmetric_visibility +
readonly_props: 226 -> 255 of 304; whole Zend/tests + ext/reflection with
--baseline: 0 new failures):
 asymmetric_visibility/{__unset,bug001,object_reference,variation,variation_nested}
 property_hooks/{array_access,bug002,bug007,get_by_ref,get_by_ref_auto,
   gh16615_001,gh18000,gh19044-8,oss-fuzz-471486164-002,
   parent_get_in_class_with_no_parent,parent_get_plain_zpp,parent_set_plain_zpp,
   parent_superfluous_args,parent_wrong_property_info,set,trait_scope}
 readonly_props/{array_append_initialization,cache_slot,gh7942,magic_get_set,
   readonly_clone_error1,readonly_clone_error4,variation,variation_nested}  (29 tests)

